WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:15.774
Eddy smiled.

2
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:20.231
"I love driving off-road.

3
00:00:20.232 --> 00:00:36.924
Dirt and rocks feel good!"

4
00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:39.480
Poppy tooted her horn.

5
00:00:39.481 --> 00:00:43.627
Honk! Honk!

6
00:00:43.628 --> 00:00:47.327
"Ugh," said Zippy.

7
00:00:47.328 --> 00:00:50.332
"I have to drive slowly.

8
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:59.797
And I'll get dirty."

9
00:00:59.798 --> 00:01:06.839
"You'll be fine, Zippy," said Mr. Grill.

10
00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:13.089
Everyone drove into the woods.

11
00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:19.589
The path had lots of rocks.

12
00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:24.934
Jeb rolled over the rocks.

13
00:01:24.935 --> 00:01:29.419
Dipper drove around them.

14
00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.879
Poppy bumped up and down.

15
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.752
"Whee!" she said.

16
00:01:36.753 --> 00:01:39.920
"This is fun!" said Eddy.

17
00:01:39.921 --> 00:01:46.209
He rolled over a big rock.

18
00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:49.368
A tree branch hit Zippy.

19
00:01:49.369 --> 00:01:52.715
"Oof!" he said.

20
00:01:52.716 --> 00:01:54.795
His tire hit a rock.

21
00:01:54.796 --> 00:01:58.714
"Ouch!" said Zippy.

22
00:01:58.715 --> 00:02:03.465
"Everybody, get ready!" said Mr. Grill.

23
00:02:03.466 --> 00:02:06.713
"The path gets muddy soon!"

24
00:02:06.714 --> 00:02:12.336
"Yay!" shouted everyone.

25
00:02:12.337 --> 00:02:18.248
"Ugh!" moaned Zippy.
